#-----------------------------------------
# Cross-project IAM for restore-test SAs that need to attach
# temporary VMs to a shared VPC hosted in a different project.
#
# Applied per-workspace where the workspace is the *host* project:
#   - prod (prod-apps-454414): hosts the shared VPC used by all bi/* modules
#-----------------------------------------
